	(text "7-bit addresses. Only the power module is on I2C_INT: INA4230 and TPS542A50 (J4 pins 38/40).\nU8 (CYPD3177, HPI address 0x08) is not on the bus, its HPI pins go to TP3/TP4. IC3 (HD3SS3220)\nruns in GPIO mode without I2C and reports the host current on OUT1 (TP5) and OUT2 (TP6), which the FX5 cannot read"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.304 155.448 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(color 120 40 200 1)
